#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Koliko se točno vaše lice mora podudarati i traži li Ubuntu Hello potvrdu da "
"ste doista prisutni."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
